{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-L4-phone-screens-1-01","date":"2026-11-20","lens":"4","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-1","refs":["F-phone-117"],"severity":"S3","title":"Find my gym also sends the member's first name, and its 'not kept' line clashes with the privacy notice","what":"To look for the member's gym, the app sends the proven mobile number and the member's first name to MettleUp's server, which matches both against gym member lists. The privacy notice says only that the number is looked for. The screen also says the number is checked once and is not kept, while the notice says WhatsApp number checks are kept for 2 days in a coded form. A member reading both gets two different stories.","expected":"The privacy notice names every detail Find my gym sends (number and first name), and the screen line and the notice say the same thing about how long the number check is kept.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/app/find-gym.tsx:118-120","apps/mobile/src/app/find-gym.tsx:257","apps/mobile/src/shop/findGym.ts:6","apps/mobile/src/shop/findGym.ts:172","apps/dashboard/public/privacy.html:81","apps/dashboard/public/privacy.html:130","apps/dashboard/public/privacy.html:189"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"find-gym-notice-misses-name","who":"members who use Find my gym","how_often":"every Find my gym search, once the feature is switched on","fix_line":"Add the first name to the Find my gym lines of the notice (both languages) and make the screen line match the 2-day coded check.","fix_size":"small","needs_him":true,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
